                                "sense_id": "d4508a19-5471-31fa-ac0c-6b8cf13fec31",
                                "text": "Suggest a dinner-pill or a seidlitz powder, and his face is convulsed with a fanatical pharmacophobia! His soul abhors the doing of such profane violence to the processes of nature!"
                            },
                            {
